{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116149","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116149/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116149/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116149/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116149","id":3923202024,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7C1PBY","number":116149,"title":"Fix quit behavior and improve cmdline tool exit logging","user":{"login":"ChrisLundquist","id":181256,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTI1Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181256?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist","html_url":"https://github.com/ChrisLundquist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisLundquist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-10T19:35:31Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T19:58:32Z","closed_at":"2026-02-10T19:55:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116149","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116149.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116149.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\r\n<p><code>--quit</code> is documented as \"Quit after the first iteration,\" but it also set <code>wait_for_import = true</code>, which blocked quitting until the full EditorFileSystem scan and reimport cycle completed. This made <code>--quit</code> inconsistent with <code>--quit-after</code> (which never set <code>wait_for_import</code>) and caused it to behave identically to <code>--import</code> rather than as a simple iteration limiter.</p>\r\n<p>This PR removes <code>wait_for_import = true</code> from <code>--quit</code> so it does what it says. The <code>--import</code> flag independently sets both <code>wait_for_import = true</code> and <code>quit_after = 1</code>, so any command using <code>--import --quit</code> is unaffected — the wait comes from <code>--import</code>.</p>\r\n\r\nCommand | Before | After\r\n-- | -- | --\r\n--quit | Waits for full scan, then quits | Quits after first iteration (as documented)\r\n--import | Waits for import, then quits | Unchanged\r\n--import --quit | Waits for import, then quits | Unchanged (--import provides wait_for_import)\r\n--quit-after N | Quits after N iterations (no wait) | Unchanged\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso adds a diagnostic \"Quitting on iteration N.\" message in <code>cmdline_tool</code> mode so CI users can distinguish between a process that exited and one that is still running.</p>\r\nRelated issues: #116084, #50839, #100465\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116149/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":2,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116149/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}